        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 137, Simple Half Round Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design, this Omnia made door knob is both elegant and timeless. It is available in brass or chrome finishes, so you will be able to find a color that will suit your taste. What is best about this 2\" diameter knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic with a durable solid brass interior, it will look beautiful no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Door Knob With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 137 Simple Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for the Omnia 137/50 Solid Brass Simple Door Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Half Round Door Knob Latchset, Omnia 137/50",
                "description": "Omnia 137/50 Simple Door Knobset - Simple in design, this Omnia made door knob is both elegant and timeless. It is available in brass or chrome finishes, so you will be able to find a color that will suit your taste. What is best about this 2 inch diameter knob is that it will never go out of style--a simple classic with a durable solid brass interior, it will look beautiful as it outlives many years of use, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it.",
